      "text": "Sonora Cartel\nThe Sonora Cartel , also known as Caro-Quintero Organization , was a Mexico based criminal cartel . Upon of the cartel 's disintegration , its leaders were incorporated into the Tijuana Cartel and Sinaloa Cartel . The Sonora Cartel , Colima Cartel and Milenio Cartel are now branches of the Sinaloa Cartel ."
